; Dispatch characters, in either order with a plain word: ! leaves out,
; = is literal, ^ anchors at the start, ~ is flex, $ anchors at the end.
> (offered '("M-x") "find !files")
("file-picker:find-file" "file-picker:find-file-other-view")
! &cancelled
