; A style set for a category is tried before completion:styles, which
; still finds what it misses. While completion:styles holds its default,
; the categories' defaults stand in for it.
> (tables:set! completion:category-styles completion:command-category (list completion:prefix))
> (offered '("M-x") "find file")
("file-picker:find-file" "file-picker:find-file-other-view")
! &cancelled
> (tables:remove! completion:category-styles completion:command-category)
> (options:set! completion:styles (options:default completion:styles))
